<title>MEXICO: GMexico 6-mos net profit falls.</title>
<headline>GMexico 6-mos net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>6-mos 1997		  6-mos 1996</p>
<p>     Shr		  n.a.		     n.a.</p>
<p>     Net		  1.320 bln		1.927 bln</p>
<p>     Revs		 5.307 bln		5.951 bln</p>
<p>     Gross profit     2.462 bln		3.053 bln</p>
<p>     Oper profit	1.895 bln		2.414 bln</p>
<p>     Integ fin gain   140.65 million	     112.86 million</p>
<p>	    Int paid    259.21 million	     n.a.</p>
<p>	    FX gain     3.32 million		 n.a.</p>
<p>	    Int earned  461.49 million	     n.a.</p>
<p>	    Mon loss    92.74 million		n.a.</p>
<p>	    NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>	    Full company name is Grupo Mexico SA.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom, +525 728-9565))</p>
</text>
